WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.360
Poppy raced over to Dipper.

2
00:00:14.361 --> 00:00:17.542
"Tag!" said Poppy.

3
00:00:17.543 --> 00:00:21.420
"You're it!"

4
00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:25.590
Eddy and Jeb laughed.

5
00:00:25.591 --> 00:00:28.563
The friends were playing tag.

6
00:00:28.564 --> 00:00:34.502
Poppy drove away fast.

7
00:00:34.503 --> 00:00:37.169
Dipper shot toward Eddy.

8
00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:40.322
"Watch out, Eddy!" said Dipper.

9
00:00:40.323 --> 00:00:42.166
"I'm it!"

10
00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:45.066
Eddy's tires spun.

11
00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:46.794
He took off.

12
00:00:46.795 --> 00:00:51.346
Dipper tagged Jeb.

13
00:00:51.347 --> 00:00:54.337
Jeb sighed.

14
00:00:54.338 --> 00:00:57.092
"I'm it again."

15
00:00:57.093 --> 00:01:00.647
"You can't catch me!" Eddy shouted.

16
00:01:00.648 --> 00:01:05.500
He zoomed away from Jeb.

17
00:01:05.501 --> 00:01:08.460
Jeb rolled slowly.

18
00:01:08.461 --> 00:01:12.544
Poppy wasn't looking.

19
00:01:12.545 --> 00:01:14.416
Jeb tagged her.

20
00:01:14.417 --> 00:01:20.047
"You're it," said Jeb.

21
00:01:20.048 --> 00:01:23.425
"This is so much fun!" said Poppy.

22
00:01:23.426 --> 00:01:29.398
"I love playing tag!"

23
00:01:29.399 --> 00:01:32.712
Poppy chased Dipper.

24
00:01:32.713 --> 00:01:35.457
Dipper got away.

25
00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:38.392
Poppy chased Eddy.

26
00:01:38.393 --> 00:01:41.088
Eddy got away.

27
00:01:41.089 --> 00:01:45.573
Then Eddy saw something.

28
00:01:45.574 --> 00:01:49.804
"Um, Poppy," he said.

29
00:01:49.805 --> 00:01:55.206
"Something is wrong!"

